"""Text the user sees or hears (menu, notifications, spoken replies), in six languages:
English, French, Spanish, German, Italian and Portuguese (Brazil).

The language is picked in the menu bar menu ([feedback] language in config.toml),
English by default. It has no effect on recognition: Parakeet, the rules and the LLM
understand French and English, whatever the interface language.
To add a language: one more column in TEXTS, a voice in VOICES, an entry in LANGUAGES,
LLM_LANGUAGE, DAYS, MONTHS and DURATION_UNITS, and one more value in the label tables (LABEL_ORDER),
including ERRORS in safety.py.

Register: the assistant addresses the user formally (vous, usted, Sie, Lei; você in Brazilian Portuguese).
Buttons and menus keep the usual interface forms (infinitive, or imperative in Italian
as in macOS: "Apri", "Annulla").
"""

